# ── Matching staging area ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTHING in this directory is committed. It is the scratch space for the
# matching workflow and holds:
#   • SCUS-94426.s and any extracted target .s  → copyrighted game code; must
#     never be redistributed (i.e. never committed)
#   • per-function permuter work dirs and their junky output-*/ directories
#
# Workflow: do all permuter work in src/matching/staging/<FuncName>/, then move
# ONLY the cleaned, finished C file out to the tracked location
#   src/matching/General/<Subdir>/<Name>.c
#
# Only this file and README.md are tracked, purely so the directory exists in
# the repo. Everything else is ignored.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
